<title>USA: Southern Farley 2 nuke returns to 100 pct.</title>
<headline>Southern Farley 2 nuke returns to 100 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Co's 822 megawatt (MW) Farley 2 nuclear power unit has returned to full output after being reduced to about 80 percent early Monday, Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The adjacent unit 1, with a generating capacity of 812 MW, is operating at 100 percent of capacity, NRC's plant status report stated.</p>
<p>The Farley facility is located in Dothan, Ala.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
